    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached property situated in the popular College Farm development in Newbridge.\n\nThe property offers well-proportioned and versatile accommodation throughout, making it an ideal home for families, first-time buyers or those looking for a comfortable modern residence.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway, which leads to the main living accommodation. The ground floor comprises a well-appointed kitchen/dining area, a separate family room, and a spacious living room, providing a choice of comfortable living and entertaining spaces. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, including a generous master bedroom with the benefit of a private ensuite. The remaining bedrooms are complemented by a family-sized bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a tarmac driveway to the front, providing ample off-street parking for several vehicles. To the rear, the garden has been designed for ease of maintenance, featuring a large decking area and stone/gravel finish, creating a practical outdoor space ideal for relaxing and entertaining.\n\nViewing of this property comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, alarm point, under stairs storage\n\nKitchen/Dining: Wooden flooring, fully fitted kitchen, ceramic kitchen sink, tiled splash back area, double oven, hob, extractor fan, American style fridge freezer, sliding patio door access to family room and double door access to living room\n\nFamily Room: Wooden flooring, recessed spot lights, French door leading to decking area\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature fireplace, privacy blinds\n\nMaster Bedroom: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor to ceiling, shower unit, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, fully fitted shelving units\n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, shower unit, WHB, WC\n\nFeatures:\n\nFully alarmed\nSelected carpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings included\nPVC front door\nPVC double glazed windows\nDecking area to rear\nBarna shed\nSide gate access to rear garden\nTarmac driveway\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 1999\nc.111.3sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
